WEBVTT

00:10.969 --> 00:12.554
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

00:12.637 --> 00:14.639
[opening theme music]

01:10.945 --> 01:12.155
[snarls]

01:33.676 --> 01:35.678
[suspenseful music]

02:01.079 --> 02:03.206
[breathing anxiously]

02:04.958 --> 02:05.834
[gasps quietly]

02:06.668 --> 02:07.836
[guard grunts]

02:43.329 --> 02:44.497
[gasps]

02:45.456 --> 02:47.625
[tense music]

02:58.011 --> 02:58.887
[gasps]

03:00.138 --> 03:01.055
Sir.

03:02.557 --> 03:03.391
Uh...

03:08.354 --> 03:09.439
Highness,

03:09.939 --> 03:11.733
I know I've committed a grave error,

03:12.066 --> 03:13.693
but I must thank you for your forgiveness.

03:13.776 --> 03:15.737
But you have done this once already.

03:16.905 --> 03:19.157
The cookies and the pomegranates.

03:20.325 --> 03:21.326
What else was there?

03:21.951 --> 03:25.413
It's so hard to remember.
You've stolen so many things from me.

03:25.496 --> 03:29.292
Highness, I deserve
to be executed for touching your table.

03:29.375 --> 03:32.879
However, I beg you,
please take pity on my wife.

03:33.630 --> 03:36.466
She worked many hours as a seamstress
supporting me,

03:37.592 --> 03:41.221
until I was finally able
to pass the exam at 40.

03:41.304 --> 03:42.472
My wife is pregnant,

03:42.555 --> 03:44.140
and is struggling
with morning sickness.

03:44.224 --> 03:45.683
She needs nourishment,

03:46.309 --> 03:48.394
and I am unable to provide that for her.

03:49.229 --> 03:50.855
It's tearing me apart.

03:51.481 --> 03:55.109
I know it's wrong to steal, but I hope
you understand it was for my wife.

03:55.693 --> 03:57.654
Sir, I'm begging you for your mercy.

03:58.529 --> 03:59.405
So then,

04:00.114 --> 04:01.866
do you truly take them home to your wife?

04:03.326 --> 04:04.535
Yes, Highness.

04:04.994 --> 04:07.205
I would never lie to His Highness
about anything.

04:08.790 --> 04:10.458
Is your wife in good health?

04:14.587 --> 04:17.048
Yes, my wife is well.

04:19.008 --> 04:20.051
[sighs]

04:26.099 --> 04:27.267
From now on...

04:33.106 --> 04:35.108
you should probably taste it first.

04:39.362 --> 04:42.073
[stammers]
What do you mean by that, sir?

04:44.450 --> 04:45.827
Am I allowed...

04:47.745 --> 04:50.290
Are you saying I can keep taking things
back to my wife?

04:57.755 --> 04:58.965
[sighs]

05:01.384 --> 05:04.387
[Chang] Let's say that I am,
what would I get in return?

05:04.929 --> 05:06.806
[Mu-yeong]
I would gladly offer anything I have

05:06.889 --> 05:08.474
in service of His Highness.

05:15.940 --> 05:17.108
I want your loyalty.

05:17.650 --> 05:20.320
That is my duty as your personal guard,
Your Highness.

05:20.403 --> 05:21.612
Of course, I would be loyal.

05:22.363 --> 05:25.533
No matter what comes or the circumstances,

05:26.117 --> 05:27.493
I want you at my side.

05:29.287 --> 05:30.580
Do you think you can do that?

05:37.670 --> 05:38.963
Yes, Highness.

05:39.922 --> 05:41.466
I can certainly do that.

05:42.967 --> 05:45.970
No matter the cost
or what I might stand to lose,

05:47.096 --> 05:49.640
I will stay at Your Highness' side
at all times.

05:49.724 --> 05:51.100
[somber music]

05:55.772 --> 05:56.647
[scoffs]

06:19.962 --> 06:20.922
Sir.

06:22.090 --> 06:23.132
We have to keep moving.

06:23.591 --> 06:26.636
Your Highness told us
that Cho Hak-ju must be destroyed.

06:26.719 --> 06:28.346
We still believe in that cause.

06:35.395 --> 06:39.107
HANYANG

06:41.776 --> 06:43.027
[man] Open the gate!

06:44.654 --> 06:47.865
The Chief State Councilor has arrived!
Open the gate!

06:50.868 --> 06:51.994
He's in critical condition.

06:52.078 --> 06:54.080
- We must act quickly to save him.
- [gasps]

06:56.207 --> 06:58.459
Uncle, are you all right?

06:59.252 --> 07:01.379
Seo-bi, what on earth do we do?

07:01.462 --> 07:03.548
I'm willing to do anything.
Just tell me what to do.

07:03.631 --> 07:04.757
Those medicines won't work.

07:04.841 --> 07:06.759
Traditional medicine
won't treat the cause.

07:06.843 --> 07:08.553
So we should just sit here
and let him die?

07:08.970 --> 07:11.556
What caused this was a bite
from the plague victims.

07:12.140 --> 07:13.599
Paying attention to the symptoms

07:13.683 --> 07:15.685
will help us learn
how to cure the disease.

07:15.768 --> 07:18.312
- We just have to be objective.
- [breathing anxiously]

07:20.106 --> 07:21.983
The creatures lose all reason.

07:22.066 --> 07:24.861
They seem to only care about where
they're getting their next meal.

07:26.112 --> 07:27.905
We've learned that
they hate water and fire.

07:28.698 --> 07:30.408
They seem to be nothing but beasts.

07:30.491 --> 07:32.160
[snarling]

07:38.458 --> 07:40.585
[stammering]
Seo-bi!

07:46.132 --> 07:48.843
[Seo-bi] The stream that saved us
wasn't even that deep,

07:49.385 --> 07:52.013
but the plague victims
were still unwilling to cross it.

07:53.681 --> 07:55.475
Burning heat scares them off.

07:56.058 --> 07:56.976
But water...

07:57.768 --> 07:59.020
Why would water?

08:00.396 --> 08:02.273
What is it that makes them hate it?

08:04.734 --> 08:06.903
[foreboding music]

08:12.617 --> 08:13.993
[groaning weakly]

08:15.578 --> 08:17.830
Will this work? Are you sure it will help?

08:17.914 --> 08:19.540
You know as much as I do.

08:19.957 --> 08:22.877
There aren't a whole lot of options
available to us at the moment.

08:24.545 --> 08:26.964
[Beom-pal stammering in alarm]

08:29.926 --> 08:32.678
[Beom-pal shrieking]

08:41.229 --> 08:43.606
[Beom-pa] Seo-bi,
something doesn't seem right.

08:55.243 --> 08:57.245
Anyone! We need help
with my uncle right now!

08:57.328 --> 08:58.246
Just a moment!

08:59.080 --> 09:00.331
[tense music]

09:16.973 --> 09:17.890
Oh!

09:18.641 --> 09:22.728
[breathing heavily]

09:31.404 --> 09:34.156
[bell ringing]

09:42.415 --> 09:43.624
What is that?

09:44.375 --> 09:46.043
Finally, our prince.

09:46.836 --> 09:48.838
It seems our dark days are over.

09:48.921 --> 09:51.674
Her Majesty has given us a prince!

09:51.757 --> 09:52.883
[council laughing]

09:52.967 --> 09:54.468
This is wonderful!

09:54.552 --> 09:56.220
[councilor 2] Wonderful!

09:56.304 --> 09:58.472
[wailing]

10:01.309 --> 10:03.769
[ominous music]

10:09.400 --> 10:11.027
[councilor] Your Majesty!

10:11.527 --> 10:16.324
Congratulations are in order
for the birth of a healthy prince!

10:16.407 --> 10:17.908
[all] Congratulations!

10:18.367 --> 10:21.329
[councilor] What a glorious day
for our kingdom.

10:21.746 --> 10:24.165
Please accept our well wishes.

10:25.207 --> 10:27.501
[menacing music]

10:34.675 --> 10:38.763
HANYANG

10:40.014 --> 10:42.308
NAESEONJAE

10:50.941 --> 10:51.859
Quickly.

10:51.942 --> 10:53.903
We need to finish the job before dawn.

10:59.283 --> 11:01.118
Looks like Your Highness' guard
was right.

11:01.202 --> 11:02.036
Look at them.

11:02.536 --> 11:03.829
They're definitely pregnant.

11:07.291 --> 11:10.044
[woman shrieking, groaning]

11:10.544 --> 11:11.379
[woman screams]

11:13.255 --> 11:14.715
[whimpering]

11:22.056 --> 11:23.099
This one is still alive.

11:28.646 --> 11:30.314
What are you trying to tell us?

11:30.648 --> 11:33.818
A murder took place
at the family residence of Her Majesty?

11:33.901 --> 11:35.861
Perhaps I was not clear enough.

11:36.487 --> 11:38.531
Seven pregnant women and female infants

11:38.614 --> 11:40.991
were found dead at Her Majesty's estate.

11:41.075 --> 11:44.453
We still don't know who has committed
this cruel act or why.

11:44.537 --> 11:45.830
What we do know...

11:46.580 --> 11:49.375
is the crime is connected
to the Queen's Palace,

11:49.458 --> 11:53.170
and that the culprit was most likely
searching for a male.

11:55.631 --> 11:56.966
Are you implying

11:57.049 --> 11:59.677
that the Queen took a baby from a commoner

12:00.010 --> 12:02.221
to fool us into believing
she birthed a prince?

12:02.304 --> 12:04.306
I have never heard such nonsense!

12:04.640 --> 12:07.393
Such a thought itself is insolent!

12:07.476 --> 12:09.270
If there's any truth to this,

12:09.353 --> 12:10.813
it will destroy this country.

12:12.732 --> 12:16.193
The head of the Royal Commandery
went there to discover the truth.

12:18.738 --> 12:21.073
[foreboding music]

12:21.824 --> 12:23.826
[councilor]
Welcome, Chief State Councilor.

12:23.909 --> 12:26.328
I wasn't aware that you returned
from Mungyeong Saejae.

12:32.168 --> 12:34.003
Where is your evidence?

12:36.589 --> 12:39.133
I ask again, where is your evidence?

12:42.136 --> 12:43.637
You had no proof

12:43.721 --> 12:46.348
when you barged
into the Office of Royal Delivery,

12:46.432 --> 12:48.851
and while she was in the pain of labor.

12:49.560 --> 12:50.895
He defiled the space

12:50.978 --> 12:53.063
where even His Majesty cannot trespass.

12:53.647 --> 12:57.526
Attacking the royal family with smears
while threatening national security.

12:58.235 --> 13:01.238
I see no other option
but to behead the Royal Commander.

13:01.322 --> 13:02.406
Lord Cho.

13:03.824 --> 13:05.201
This is unprecedented.

13:05.284 --> 13:07.203
We could never behead
such a high-ranking officer.

13:07.286 --> 13:08.788
One officer is not enough!

13:10.247 --> 13:12.374
The training commander
in Mungyeong Saejae...

13:13.501 --> 13:15.044
along with the soldiers

13:15.127 --> 13:17.797
for joining the traitor, Chang,
should also be beheaded!

13:18.464 --> 13:20.049
Lord Cho, that is preposterous.

13:20.132 --> 13:21.592
Think about what you are saying.

13:21.675 --> 13:22.968
Those are our soldiers!

13:23.052 --> 13:24.678
Why would they ally themselves with him?

13:24.762 --> 13:26.597
The reasons are never important.

13:27.515 --> 13:29.892
When will you realize
these men are against you?

13:30.351 --> 13:32.478
And we must punish them with a swift hand

13:32.561 --> 13:34.855
so that justice may return
just as quickly.

13:41.153 --> 13:43.531
They want to join hands with a traitor.

13:45.074 --> 13:47.243
That makes the rest of them the same.

13:47.743 --> 13:50.079
We'll behead their families
and relatives...

13:51.914 --> 13:54.667
and their wives' families and relatives.

13:56.085 --> 13:59.296
And their mothers' families as well,
to set an example.

13:59.380 --> 14:03.133
We cannot simply kill these people.
Not without a proper investigation.

14:06.387 --> 14:08.180
[councilors gasp]

14:10.015 --> 14:12.434
For our national security,
it must be done.

14:17.773 --> 14:19.608
Are there any objections?

14:26.365 --> 14:28.993
[soldier] Gather all the families.
Do not let anyone escape.

14:29.535 --> 14:32.204
[panicked voices, screaming]

14:32.288 --> 14:33.289
[soldier] Quiet!

14:34.915 --> 14:35.791
[gasps]

14:37.376 --> 14:39.378
Stop this at once!
Do you even know where you are?

14:41.130 --> 14:43.090
[both scream]

14:49.555 --> 14:50.556
[guard 1] Come!

14:50.639 --> 14:51.557
[guard 2] Move it!

14:53.183 --> 14:54.393
Get up!

14:54.476 --> 14:55.519
[man whimpering]

14:58.355 --> 15:00.316
Come on, we should hurry.

15:02.234 --> 15:04.028
What made them guilty of treason?

15:05.237 --> 15:07.865
The people and soldiers
in Mungyeong Saejae aren't traitors.

15:08.282 --> 15:09.909
You know that better than anyone, my lord.

15:09.992 --> 15:13.245
Watch what you say. Are you not aware
of how scary my uncle is?

15:13.329 --> 15:15.164
[indistinct chatter]

15:15.247 --> 15:16.624
[girl] Daddy!

15:18.459 --> 15:19.418
Daddy!

15:20.669 --> 15:22.212
Daddy!

15:22.630 --> 15:23.923
Daddy?

15:24.590 --> 15:26.967
Daddy...

15:27.051 --> 15:28.260
Daddy...

15:28.344 --> 15:30.095
- [soldier 3] Shut up!
- Let's get out of here.

15:32.306 --> 15:34.808
Did you need to buy herbs?
The apothecary is over that way.

15:34.892 --> 15:36.185
I can get them alone.

15:36.268 --> 15:39.563
Why don't you go to the house?
Please, you should go on without me.

15:46.528 --> 15:48.155
[women whimpering]

16:05.297 --> 16:06.298
[gasps]

16:07.508 --> 16:09.718
[suspenseful music]

16:11.804 --> 16:12.680
[sighs]

16:15.391 --> 16:17.851
SCHOLARLY INSTITUTION
NEAR THE CITADEL OF HANYANG

16:20.521 --> 16:22.773
THOSE WHO TRESPASS ON THE INSTITUTION
WILL BE PUT TO DEATH

16:23.440 --> 16:24.650
[breathing heavily]

16:32.616 --> 16:33.867
[weakly]
They took...

16:37.788 --> 16:40.374
They took my baby.

16:41.041 --> 16:43.043
[somber music]

16:43.127 --> 16:44.086
[woman sighs]

17:00.686 --> 17:02.062
How is her condition?

17:03.313 --> 17:05.232
She's out of the critical stages.

17:05.315 --> 17:07.693
She doesn't seem
like she can handle the shock.

17:07.776 --> 17:09.611
Highness, may I ask how you know her?

17:11.530 --> 17:12.990
She is Mu-yeong's wife.

17:15.034 --> 17:16.493
[sighs]

17:20.414 --> 17:22.082
Is it true Cho Hak-ju has recovered?

17:31.008 --> 17:32.009
And what is this?

17:32.634 --> 17:34.136
This worm is the disease.

17:38.849 --> 17:41.351
Just below the bloom, these white spots,

17:41.602 --> 17:43.062
those are eggs from this worm.

17:43.145 --> 17:45.189
If a person were to ingest this flower,

17:45.272 --> 17:47.858
the eggs would hatch
and turn them into a monster.

17:50.611 --> 17:52.488
What about how to stop it?

17:52.571 --> 17:54.698
Are we any closer to finding a cure?

17:55.157 --> 17:56.658
We must save those in Sangju.

17:57.242 --> 18:00.496
I'm sorry, Your Highness, but it will be
a while before I can cure it.

18:00.579 --> 18:01.455
[sighs]

18:03.373 --> 18:06.543
Chaos in such a tiny package.

18:08.045 --> 18:09.713
It's taken countless lives,

18:10.047 --> 18:12.007
nearly destroyed the Gyeongsang Province,

18:13.342 --> 18:16.136
and has brought the entire kingdom
to its knees.

18:18.138 --> 18:19.807
All from a worm.

18:20.307 --> 18:22.226
Are you all right, Your Majesty?

18:24.978 --> 18:26.897
I know you have some injuries.

18:27.481 --> 18:29.566
Dongnae would've been difficult
for anyone.

18:30.234 --> 18:32.152
There are plenty others
that have suffered worse.

18:32.236 --> 18:34.530
And even more will be hurt
by the end of this.

18:37.908 --> 18:39.368
I will put a stop to it.

18:42.162 --> 18:43.205
[sighs]

18:46.875 --> 18:48.001
To do that,

18:48.836 --> 18:50.546
I need you to do something first.

19:03.350 --> 19:04.560
My lord.

19:05.144 --> 19:06.145
[gasps]

19:07.020 --> 19:09.648
What kind of herb did you need
that it took you this long to get it?

19:09.731 --> 19:10.941
My lord...

19:12.276 --> 19:13.569
I must ask a favor.

19:14.069 --> 19:15.112
[ominous music]

19:16.947 --> 19:18.532
You wish to work

19:19.116 --> 19:21.118
as Her Majesty's physician?

19:24.246 --> 19:26.456
This woman was the one
who saved you, Uncle.

19:27.166 --> 19:28.667
She deserves a reward.

19:29.001 --> 19:30.711
I ask that you consider her request.

19:31.295 --> 19:34.715
I was planning to visit Her Majesty
to honor the Prince.

19:35.716 --> 19:37.134
Perhaps you should come.

19:42.764 --> 19:44.600
[sighs sharply]

19:46.310 --> 19:48.061
THE QUEEN'S PALACE, INNER ROOM

19:49.938 --> 19:51.398
- [baby coos]
- Hm.

19:52.649 --> 19:53.817
[court lady] Your Majesty.

19:54.318 --> 19:57.196
The Chief State Councilor is here
for an audience.

20:02.492 --> 20:03.869
You may let him in.

20:03.952 --> 20:05.829
[tense music]

20:13.003 --> 20:14.213
[door closes]

20:22.346 --> 20:25.349
I was so concerned
after hearing that you had fallen ill.

20:26.141 --> 20:27.643
Have you made a full recovery?

20:28.977 --> 20:31.688
And Saejae,
did things go smoothly for you?

20:43.909 --> 20:45.494
It's my little prince.

20:45.869 --> 20:49.623
Look at him. He's so healthy and bright.

20:51.291 --> 20:52.626
We have him now.

21:00.634 --> 21:03.804
I heard you'll be executing
all the soldiers and their families.

21:04.763 --> 21:05.973
It was a wise choice.

21:06.056 --> 21:09.393
No men loyal to you would ever side
with the Crown Prince.

21:09.476 --> 21:11.311
It is beyond comprehension.

21:13.563 --> 21:14.606
They're the bait.

21:16.108 --> 21:18.652
The means for me to draw Chang
out of hiding.

21:24.408 --> 21:27.327
There is another
who has committed a grave sin...

21:28.829 --> 21:30.372
and who should die.

21:33.083 --> 21:35.085
[ominous music]

21:39.381 --> 21:40.299
[sighs]

21:47.306 --> 21:48.932
The woman in the next room...

21:50.559 --> 21:52.644
she is a skilled physician
in her own right.

21:53.186 --> 21:55.564
I am greatly concerned
by the physical toll

21:55.647 --> 21:57.357
that birth has taken on you.

21:57.441 --> 21:59.735
I would like her to examine your pulse.

22:01.987 --> 22:05.532
What would I stand to gain from a commoner
looking after my health?

22:07.576 --> 22:09.077
Why do you wait?

22:10.787 --> 22:12.956
Her pulse needs to be examined.

22:14.458 --> 22:15.625
Father, stop.

22:16.418 --> 22:18.086
[foreboding music]

22:24.843 --> 22:25.969
[sighs]

22:27.054 --> 22:27.888
[gasps]

22:30.640 --> 22:32.184
[breathing anxiously]

22:34.770 --> 22:36.646
I am done repeating myself!

22:43.070 --> 22:44.863
If you have nothing to hide,

22:46.865 --> 22:48.325
then let her take your pulse.

23:13.058 --> 23:14.101
[sighs]

23:19.773 --> 23:21.066
What did you find?

23:22.025 --> 23:23.568
No rough pulse.

23:24.528 --> 23:26.113
Her heart is beating normally.

23:26.780 --> 23:28.740
And what does that mean, exactly?

23:29.991 --> 23:32.202
[breathing anxiously]

23:36.248 --> 23:37.666
That baby...

23:38.834 --> 23:41.378
is not Her Majesty's child.

23:44.214 --> 23:45.799
When did you plan this?

23:52.764 --> 23:54.433
Explain what's going on.

23:54.850 --> 23:59.521
Sir, the cubit and pregnancy pulse
are not present at all.

23:59.604 --> 24:01.606
[Beom-il] Does that mean
Her Majesty lost the baby?

24:01.690 --> 24:04.151
[whimpers]
Please punish us.

24:04.693 --> 24:05.527
[sighs]

24:06.361 --> 24:07.446
I thought we told you

24:07.529 --> 24:10.157
- to take care of Her Majesty?
- [both gasp, whimper]

24:10.240 --> 24:14.119
We apologize, but the thoroughfare
and conception vessels are too weak.

24:14.202 --> 24:16.204
We tried every remedy
we could think of,

24:16.288 --> 24:18.498
but nothing has been successful, my lord.

24:19.249 --> 24:21.626
[Beom-il] Is conceiving one child...

24:22.085 --> 24:24.254
- really that difficult?
- [physicians whimpering]

24:24.713 --> 24:27.090
I will have no issue bearing your child.

24:31.887 --> 24:33.597
I am ready to give him an heir

24:34.014 --> 24:35.265
and it will be a boy.

24:35.682 --> 24:37.350
[male royal physician whimpering]

24:38.685 --> 24:41.021
You would dare consider
faking a pregnancy?

24:41.480 --> 24:44.816
How would you go about fooling
all the eyes and ears of the palace?

24:45.233 --> 24:47.235
Forget this preposterous idea.

24:47.861 --> 24:51.072
Focus on your health.
You need to conceive.

24:52.657 --> 24:55.410
His Majesty is well over 50 years old.

24:55.952 --> 24:58.497
What if he were to pass on
before I got pregnant?

25:00.373 --> 25:01.833
So you'll just stand aside...

25:02.334 --> 25:03.460
like a dog?

25:06.421 --> 25:09.090
Watching the prince that you despise
ascend to the throne?

25:09.174 --> 25:10.967
[ominous music]

25:14.804 --> 25:17.974
Not even the King himself can touch me
when I am with child.

25:18.225 --> 25:20.894
Working out a solution
wouldn't be that difficult.

25:22.771 --> 25:25.607
We'd need to swear everyone
in my service to secrecy.

25:27.359 --> 25:28.610
And what of our father?

25:30.195 --> 25:32.447
It will not have our blood in its veins.

25:33.323 --> 25:35.116
He would never accept such a thing.

25:35.534 --> 25:36.701
Of course.

25:39.287 --> 25:41.373
We will keep it a secret from him too.

25:43.708 --> 25:45.126
What if he finds out?

25:49.714 --> 25:52.384
You have cursed me with this
since you were a girl.

25:52.467 --> 25:54.719
You were gifted at birth
with a wicked cunning,

25:54.803 --> 25:56.805
but you have always been foolish.

25:57.639 --> 25:59.516
And now it has brought us this,

25:59.599 --> 26:02.310
putting everything
we struggled for at risk.

26:03.228 --> 26:05.772
The Haewon Cho Clan
is on the brink of its demise.

26:05.855 --> 26:08.483
You're wrong.
I was the one who protected us.

26:08.567 --> 26:10.485
What can you protect with a commoner child

26:10.569 --> 26:12.404
that does not even know its own mother?

26:14.656 --> 26:16.658
I do not want that for my country.

26:17.534 --> 26:18.994
I will not have any of it.

26:20.370 --> 26:21.621
What now?

26:22.998 --> 26:25.208
Will you take back what you did to Chang

26:25.667 --> 26:27.627
all because you don't like this baby?

26:29.754 --> 26:31.548
Prince Noseong was exiled.

26:33.425 --> 26:35.468
But his children are alive
on Ganghwa Island.

26:35.552 --> 26:36.386
[sighs]

26:36.469 --> 26:38.430
They may be distant relatives,

26:38.513 --> 26:40.890
but they are more suited
to the throne than him.

26:42.392 --> 26:43.977
As for that child...

26:45.520 --> 26:47.689
I will put an end to his life tonight.

26:47.772 --> 26:48.773
But I will not stop there.

26:49.774 --> 26:51.860
Countless more will need to die.

26:52.777 --> 26:54.946
Your court ladies and all your physicians.

26:56.531 --> 26:59.492
Anyone else you might
have included in this farce.

27:00.827 --> 27:02.203
It would be done. 

27:03.872 --> 27:06.082
Nothing but a childless dowager

27:06.833 --> 27:08.335
locked in the West Palace.

27:09.794 --> 27:10.629
[coughs]

27:11.296 --> 27:12.505
[ominous music]

27:18.553 --> 27:20.722
Punished as you live out
the rest of your days.

27:22.515 --> 27:23.433
[coughs]

27:39.908 --> 27:41.284
[Beom-il] And what of our father?

27:41.618 --> 27:43.912
It will not have our blood in its veins.

27:43.995 --> 27:45.455
He would never accept such a thing.

27:46.081 --> 27:47.415
What if he finds out?

27:54.422 --> 27:55.340
[grunts]

28:01.805 --> 28:02.889
[splutters]

28:09.604 --> 28:10.438
[retches]

28:41.970 --> 28:43.722
Has there ever been a time
you didn't hate me?

28:46.808 --> 28:49.394
All for having the nerve
of being born a girl?

28:54.399 --> 28:56.359
I never needed your approval.

29:00.321 --> 29:02.866
I'm about to have everything
you ever wanted.

29:07.662 --> 29:09.831
I'm the most powerful Haewon Cho.

29:12.292 --> 29:13.710
This kingdom...

29:16.713 --> 29:18.590
must fall at my feet.

29:28.224 --> 29:30.185
[foreboding music]

29:31.561 --> 29:32.812
YOGEUM GATE

29:32.896 --> 29:34.105
[sobbing]

29:59.088 --> 30:04.928
[chanting]

30:05.011 --> 30:06.805
[men chanting]

30:06.888 --> 30:09.390
[man] I hear he died from the plague.

30:09.474 --> 30:13.228
Even the Chief State Councilor
isn't safe from it.

30:13.311 --> 30:14.354
[sighs]

30:14.437 --> 30:16.439
He was a powerful man.

30:16.523 --> 30:19.859
Now, he and His Majesty
have died to this disease.

30:19.943 --> 30:22.028
Not much hope for us, is there?

30:24.197 --> 30:25.907
We're all gonna die soon.

30:26.950 --> 30:30.328
[man chanting in distance]

30:31.454 --> 30:34.249
[men chanting in distance]

30:42.799 --> 30:44.551
[yawns]

30:45.051 --> 30:46.469
GANGHWA ISLAND

30:46.553 --> 30:49.973
Oh, it's cold.
[blows]

30:52.267 --> 30:54.394
Either join me or leave me alone.

30:54.477 --> 30:57.397
I don't like you standing
and watching me in the cold.

31:06.447 --> 31:07.699
It's been a few hours.

31:08.783 --> 31:10.952
You haven't caught a single fish,
have you?

31:12.370 --> 31:13.788
Are you trying to pick a fight?

31:15.874 --> 31:17.917
All of our food sources have gone dry.

31:18.334 --> 31:20.962
Same goes for the fish,
there's hardly any out there.

31:22.589 --> 31:23.423
[sighs]

31:23.506 --> 31:26.050
I'd be happy for the opportunity
to catch anything at all

31:26.134 --> 31:27.635
the way this week has been.

31:29.137 --> 31:30.388
[chuckles]

31:31.264 --> 31:34.809
You know, these days,
people worship food like a god.

31:35.435 --> 31:38.146
But that just means
this country has gone to hell.

31:38.980 --> 31:40.648
[chuckling]

31:42.400 --> 31:43.526
Oh, oh!

31:43.610 --> 31:44.694
Oh, grab that, please!

31:44.777 --> 31:46.404
Oh, oh, do you have it?

31:46.487 --> 31:48.448
Oh, okay! Easy, easy, easy!

31:48.531 --> 31:50.199
Hold on. Hold on!

31:50.283 --> 31:51.367
Oh, let me help.

31:51.492 --> 31:53.161
- [grunts]
- No, no, no, don't pull.

31:53.244 --> 31:55.288
That's it. That's it--

31:58.416 --> 31:59.375
[sighs]

32:01.377 --> 32:02.253
Hey...

32:03.296 --> 32:04.464
Why did you...

32:04.547 --> 32:07.300
[sighs sharply]
I don't know what I did to deserve this.

32:09.761 --> 32:10.887
You, sir,

32:10.970 --> 32:12.805
I hope to never see again.

32:14.015 --> 32:15.266
And lost my fish.

32:16.851 --> 32:18.102
But why did you pull?

32:18.561 --> 32:19.938
I told you to hold it.

32:22.774 --> 32:23.608
Uncle.

32:30.823 --> 32:32.283
What did you call me?

32:33.284 --> 32:34.577
I checked my family tree.

32:35.495 --> 32:37.246
You would be my distant uncle.

32:39.415 --> 32:41.876
You're a forgotten member
of the royal family.

32:42.335 --> 32:43.336
Even so...

32:44.253 --> 32:46.589
bloodlines cannot remain hidden
for very long.

32:47.340 --> 32:50.218
"People have a tendency
to worship food like a god."

32:52.261 --> 32:53.846
Is it The Book of Han you're reading?

32:55.890 --> 32:57.642
"The royal bloodlines."

32:59.852 --> 33:01.020
What do you know?

33:02.772 --> 33:04.774
It doesn't matter who it belongs to.

33:05.274 --> 33:08.111
Your Highness, or I, or even some lowborn.

33:08.945 --> 33:10.905
We all bleed the same blood.

33:12.573 --> 33:14.909
It may have lost its meaning for you.

33:15.994 --> 33:17.328
In this country, though,

33:18.830 --> 33:20.540
it is our most important asset.

33:22.792 --> 33:24.419
Through the generations,

33:25.420 --> 33:27.088
our blood stays strong.

33:39.058 --> 33:41.060
[poignant music]

33:45.023 --> 33:47.275
Our soldiers' families
have been rounded up.

33:48.192 --> 33:49.569
They'll be killed tomorrow.

33:52.405 --> 33:53.364
Tell me...

33:54.657 --> 33:56.325
why are you so loyal?

33:58.494 --> 34:00.913
I heard about
what happened to your family.

34:03.374 --> 34:05.126
I know that's why you helped me.

34:05.585 --> 34:07.211
So that you could avenge them.

34:09.505 --> 34:11.591
My master and Cho Hak-ju are gone.

34:15.261 --> 34:17.346
Their sins will lay to rest with them.

34:20.975 --> 34:22.143
So why?

34:26.814 --> 34:28.649
Why are you still standing here?

34:31.110 --> 34:32.570
Since they've gone...

34:33.571 --> 34:35.490
have we gotten any meat or rice?

34:37.784 --> 34:40.078
Even though they're gone,
everything is the same.

34:40.411 --> 34:43.581
The country is a mess.
Everyone in it is starving.

34:46.959 --> 34:48.419
But I believe in you.

34:50.379 --> 34:52.840
I think you can bring about
the changes we need.

34:55.968 --> 34:57.178
Was I mistaken?

35:04.936 --> 35:07.271
Such a horrific tragedy for the nation.

35:07.730 --> 35:10.900
I was concerned about keeping up
with my duties as a queen.

35:10.983 --> 35:13.986
You are kind enough to make
the arrangements for the funeral,

35:14.070 --> 35:15.071
and I'm very grateful.

35:15.530 --> 35:19.075
I was simply doing
what was necessary of me, Your Majesty.

35:20.451 --> 35:24.455
Yes, but you have a kind heart
and have gone out of your way for me.

35:25.248 --> 35:27.500
That is why I am so fond of you, Beom-pal.

35:28.042 --> 35:29.460
Oh... Oh.

35:29.794 --> 35:30.795
That's very kind of you--

35:30.878 --> 35:32.588
Might I request another favor?

35:33.756 --> 35:37.468
My family's gone. Now that
my father and brother are no more...

35:38.970 --> 35:41.347
I have no one left to watch over us.

35:42.682 --> 35:44.100
You're being promoted.

35:44.559 --> 35:47.478
I'd like to appoint you as the head
of the Royal Commandery.

35:47.562 --> 35:50.022
You'll stay by my side
with my palace guards

35:50.106 --> 35:52.233
and help protect me and my prince.

35:55.236 --> 35:57.738
I am honored to accept these orders,
Your Majesty.

35:59.282 --> 36:00.283
[chuckles]

36:01.492 --> 36:03.619
But there is one matter
I'd like to discuss.

36:05.663 --> 36:07.123
Just before he passed away,

36:07.206 --> 36:09.250
my uncle visited Your Majesty's chambers

36:09.333 --> 36:12.003
with a female physician.
Would you know what happened---

36:12.086 --> 36:15.047
I sent her away
as I already have a physician.

36:15.548 --> 36:17.216
She wasn't necessary here.

36:18.718 --> 36:20.011
[sighs]
I see.

36:42.575 --> 36:44.285
[infected snarling]

36:45.077 --> 36:46.037
[shrieks]

36:52.460 --> 36:55.004
[Queen] I heard you've studied
under Lee Seung-hui.

36:55.922 --> 36:56.964
Is this true?

36:59.342 --> 37:02.220
You will do everything in your power
to learn more about the plague.

37:03.137 --> 37:04.889
Your teacher wasn't good enough.

37:05.681 --> 37:07.558
I hope you have more success.

37:12.855 --> 37:14.899
[snarling]

37:14.982 --> 37:17.109
My father had the right idea.

37:19.987 --> 37:21.739
These monsters are powerful.

37:22.490 --> 37:24.325
I can add their power to mine.

37:25.076 --> 37:27.578
[infected snarling]

37:31.832 --> 37:33.167
[gasps, whimpers]

37:35.795 --> 37:37.338
- [snarling]
- [gasps]

37:44.220 --> 37:46.264
[whimpering]

37:57.900 --> 37:59.777
[snarling continues]

38:07.535 --> 38:09.537
[closing theme music]
